        "original_id": "c11b6faa-39bb-57bf-8327-e22bcac0d7ab",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Margaret Stanley, Countess of Derby; Lady Margaret Clifford; Henry Clifford, 2nd Earl of Cumberland; Lady Eleanor Brandon\n- Places: Skipton Castle\n- Families: Clifford family\n\nFacts:\n- Henry Clifford, 2nd Earl of Cumberland, was born in 1517 and died in January 1570.\n- Margaret Stanley, Countess of Derby, née Lady Margaret Clifford, was born in 1540 and died on 28 September 1596.\n- Margaret Stanley, Countess of Derby, was the only surviving daughter of Henry Clifford, 2nd Earl of Cumberland, and Lady Eleanor Brandon.\n- Henry Clifford, 2nd Earl of Cumberland, was a member of the Clifford family.\n- The Clifford family was seated at Skipton Castle from 1310 to 1676.",
